OL,3,AFive shot in Washington DC, police say,
OL,4,Awith suspect barricaded in building
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people have been shot in central
OL,7,FWashington DC, in what police describe
OL,8,Fas an "active shooting"
OL,10,FAt the moment, officers "don't know the
OL,11,Fstatus" of the victims
OL,13,FPhotos show a large police presence at
OL,14,Fthe scene of 15th and P Street,
OL,15,FNorthwest - they say "the incident has
OL,16,Fresulted in a barricade situation"
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
