OL,3,AEight killed and at least 19 injured in
OL,4,ANew York building collapse as rescuers
OL,5,Ascour wreckage
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least eight people have died after a
OL,8,Fthree-storey building collapsed on
OL,9,FWednesday in Brooklyn
OL,11,FThe city's fire department says 19
OL,12,Fpeople have been injured, with four in
OL,13,Fhospital in a critical condition
OL,15,FNew York City's mayor Zohran Mamdani
OL,16,Fsays rescuers spent the night "working
OL,17,Funder extremely dangerous conditions" -
OL,18,Fread his update in full
OL,20,FRescue efforts are ongoing, as images
OL,21,Fshow dozens of emergency workers
OL,22,Fcontinuing to scour the wreckage
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
